# MODULE sixteen bit guest execution step
# PURPOSE combine branch selection guest fuel and original BF opcode effects
# INPUT one count byte then twelve bytes for each requested guest step
# INPUT opcode pc low high partner low high old cell fuel low high pointer budget input present input byte
# OUTPUT status next pc low high fuel low high old cell after next pointer output flag output byte
# TAPE numbered register cells zero through ninety three with distinct temporary registers
# PROFILE wrapping byte arithmetic input zero on EOF and original command fuel check
# PROFILE left bound trap and right logical tape budget trap before movement
# PROFILE bracket jump target must be validated from the admitted same source
# LIMITATION caller still owns fetch tape storage guest input authority and bracket validation
# LIMITATION source and host transport closure are independent and mandatory
# LIMITATION sixteen bit positions and fuel are bounded diagnostic representations
# END header

